---
import SimplePageLayout from '@layouts/SimplePageLayout.astro';
import Portrait from '@components/Portrait.astro';
import { site } from '@i18n/sections';
import { labels } from '@i18n/ui';
const locale = 'en';
---

<SimplePageLayout title={site.title[locale]} description={site.description[locale]} pageTitle={labels[locale].about} locale={locale}>
	<Portrait slot="margin" locale={locale} />
	<p class="lead">{site.description[locale]}</p>
	<p>I'm a Computer Engineering graduate from King Fahd University of Petroleum & Minerals (KFUPM), a software engineer, and an entrepreneur with a passion for building technology that makes a real difference.</p>

<p>My interests lie at the intersection of artificial intelligence, software engineering, and business. I believe that great technology starts with understanding real problems, not just finding ways to use the latest tools. This mindset shapes my approach to building products, where technical decisions are guided by the value they bring to people.</p>

<p>Through my experience in software development and co-founding an AI startup, I've had the opportunity to turn ideas into working products, face real technical and business challenges, and learn what it takes to bring a product to life.</p>

<p>Beyond building software, I enjoy exploring new technologies, understanding how businesses work, and learning from the experiences of others. I believe continuous learning, experimentation, and sharing knowledge are essential parts of personal and professional growth.</p>

<p>This blog is my personal space to share thoughts on <strong>AI and technology</strong>, explore ideas in <strong>business and entrepreneurship</strong>, and <strong>document my projects</strong>, including the decisions, challenges, mistakes, and lessons I've learned along the way.</p>
	<h2>{labels[locale].skills}</h2>
	<ul class="skills">{site.skills.map((skill) => <li>{skill}</li>)}</ul>
</SimplePageLayout>
